; Editor schema bundles for the native `sjon-lsp`.
;
; This is an editor-local file: the language server reads it to give each
; document its own complete schema. The CLI ignores it, and `sjon.wasm` /
; `sjon-lsp.wasm` never discover it.
;
; A bundle matches against the document's `/`-normalized path relative to
; this file's directory. `*` is one segment; a whole `**` segment is zero or
; more. Only the nearest `sjon-lsp.sjon` is consulted: nothing is inherited
; from a parent directory.
;
; `:manifests` are resolved relative to this file too, in declaration order.
; Both plugins below already ship in this repository; copy the example out
; and point these paths at your own manifests.

(sjon-lsp :version 1
  :bundles [
    (bundle :name gpu-textures
      :files ["gpu/*.sjon"]
      :manifests ["../plugins/dimensions/plugin.sjon"])

    (bundle :name geometry
      :files ["geometry/*.sjon"]
      :manifests ["../plugins/units/plugin.sjon"])])
